{"No nil guard after where().first in update and destroy causes 500 on missing record - EmbeddableHost.where(id: params[:id]).first returns nil if record doesn't exist, leading to NoMethodError instead of 404": 0.9367128014564514, "Case-insensitive host lookup only lowercases the DB side, not the input - where(\"lower(host) = ?\", host).first applies lower() to the DB column but compares against raw uri.host which preserves case, causing no match when DB stores lowercase but input has uppercase": 0.9244276881217957, "SQL injection via string interpolation in migration - execute \"INSERT INTO embeddable_hosts ... VALUES ('#{h}', ...)\" interpolates h directly into SQL without sanitization, allowing SQL injection through host values containing single quotes": 0.8414648175239563, "Migration crashes if embed_category setting doesn't exist - execute(\"SELECT ... WHERE s.name = 'embed_category'\")[0]['id'] raises NoMethodError when no rows returned because result[0] is nil": 0.9308274984359741, "Plural _ids hydration unconditionally deletes original key even when lookups fail - the plural _ids branch always deletes the original key unlike the singular branch which checks if (hydrated), causing loss of original ids when lookups fail": 0.9111137390136719, "Fabricator file names are swapped - category_fabricator.rb contains Fabricator(:embeddable_host) while embeddable_host_fabricator.rb contains Fabricator(:category)": 0.9704574346542358}